# Tough Cookie's {2}{G} targets any noncreature artifact you control (CR 115.1), a Food token among them: it becomes a 4/4 artifact
# creature until end of turn and keeps being a Food (CR 205.1b: the effect adds the Creature type; "Food" is an artifact subtype).
# Bot1 casts the Cookie on turn 1 (its Food token is made) and animates the token on turn 3; it attacks for 4. The Cookie, a Food
# itself but a creature already, isn't a legal target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Tough Cookie
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tough Cookie.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Tough Cookie.Activate(Ability: becomes; Bot1.Battlefield.Tough Cookie)
Bot1.Battlefield.Tough Cookie.Activate(Ability: becomes; Bot1.Battlefield.Food Token)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Food Token.Types = Artifact; Creature
? Bot1.Battlefield.Food Token.Subtypes = Food
? Bot1.Battlefield.Food Token.Power = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Food Token.Toughness = 4
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Food Token > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
